claim.claim-text:
detecting, by a microphone of a first electronic device of multiple electronic devices, a voice input;
determining, by one or more processors, a first quality score for the voice input;
determining, based at least in part on the first quality score and one or more second quality scores associated with one or more other electronic devices of the multiple electronic devices, that the electronic device is a leader device; and
outputting, by the electronic device, a response to the voice input.

a first electronic device including a first microphone;
one or more other electronic devices;
one or more processors; and
one or more memory devices comprising instructions that, when executed by the one or more processors, cause the one or more processors to perform operations comprising:

detecting, by the first microphone, a voice input;
determining a first quality score for the voice input that was detected;
determining, based at least in part on the first quality score and one or more second quality scores associated with the one or more other electronic devices, that the first electronic device is a leader device; and
outputting, by the first electronic device, a response to the voice input.

detecting, by a microphone of an electronic device of multiple electronic devices, a voice input;
determining a first quality score for the voice input that was detected;
determining, based at least in part on the first quality score and one or more second quality scores associated with one or more other electronic devices of the multiple electronic devices, that the electronic device is a leader device; and
outputting, by the electronic device, a response to the voice input.
